	$D_{\mathrm{v},i} \times D_{\mathrm{v},j}$ with $z$ uniformly random on
	$\ell_Z$, and, since
	$T^{\ell_X,\ell_Z,z}_{b}
	= \E_{x \in \ell_X} \sum_a
